(7592849, 1224421, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Brilliant Lev,  I know this has happened to me sometimes when Ive been down the beach and missed focus, the end result is awesome. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Anita! Happened to me too, of course, but in this particular case, I did it on purpose :). It was not so easy, since I did not have a neutral density filter for this lens, and so I was holding a bigger one against the lens with one hand while aiming and shooting with another.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-08-17 22:14:21.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Brilliant Lev,  I know this has happened to me sometimes when Ive been down the beach and missed focus, the end result is awesome.  Thanks Anita! Happened to me too, of course, but in this particular case, I did it on purpose :). It was not so easy, since I did not have a neutral density filter for this lens, and so I was holding a bigger one against the lens with one hand while aiming and shooting with another.', '2018-08-17 23:13:57.000000', '2018-08-17 23:14:21.000000', 0),
(7592853, 1223921, 124815, '<td valign="top">Have to say that I strongly disagree with <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/38032.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/38032.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/38032.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=38032" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tate</a> on the reflection. To me it added this feeling of being seen and listened. And the time on the clock is truly superfluous in the context. Great image.</td>', 'Have to say that I strongly disagree with  tate on the reflection. To me it added this feeling of being seen and listened. And the time on the clock is truly superfluous in the context. Great image.', '2018-08-18 00:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
